<http://data.silknow.org/object/5df56cad-a2dd-39b3-b226-0e6ff8ffa2e7>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Darning or running stitch sampler. Across the top are the alphabet and the numbers 1-10. Beneath this are rows of rectangular bands having geometric and linear motives, some intersecting at right angles to form crosses. A narrow band runs horizontally across the field with the inscription \"M*ADRIANBNSSBNS*1838*DBN---\" Border on two sides of a simple leafy vine. Slightly soiled and stained.  Stitches: cross, pattern darning, simple darning."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/1d6c2c8c-5421-3fab-9581-db7cf821d255> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Darning or running stitch sampler. Across the top are the alphabet and the numbers 1-10. Beneath this are rows of rectangular bands having geometric and linear motives, some intersecting at right angles to form crosses. A narrow band runs horizontally across the field with the inscription \"M*ADRIANBNSSBNS*1838*DBN---\" Border on two sides of a simple leafy vine. Slightly soiled and stained.  Stitches: cross, pattern darning, simple darning."@en ;
